    "label": "处理多项式 gamma(s) 有三种方法：采用图 7.48(b) 的实现结构使其满足 gamma(s)=alpha_e(s)；直接采用式 (7.198) 给出的 gamma(s) 以实现误差控制；或者根据式 (7.192) 选取 M/N_bar 赋予 gamma(s) 任意系数。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "There are three ways to handle the polynomial gamma(s): select it so that gamma(s)=alpha_e(s) by using the implementation of Fig. 7.48(b); accept gamma(s) as given by Eq. (7.198) so that error control is used; or give gamma(s) arbitrary coefficients by selecting M/N_bar from Eq. (7.192).",
